     "to": "Maker pages checked 2026-11-25: 135 x 118 x 116-158 mm (height adjustable, 116 mm taken as the height value), 560 g, two FOC brushless hub motors (48 mm, D 48 mm x H 20 mm) plus two 4.5 kg.cm magnetic-encoder serial-bus leg servos, 1400 mAh 2S 18500 pack (10.36 Wh computed as 7.4 V x 1.4 Ah), Raspberry Pi CM5 2 GB with ESP32 co-processor, 5 MP OV5647 camera, dual MEMS microphones and a 2 W speaker, USB-C charging, Python and ROS development, open ESP32 motion firmware under Apache 2.0. Runtime is stated as about 2 h in the maker's wiki and about 1 h on the product page, so the wiki figure is used and both are recorded here; top speed and payload are not published."
